cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository contains the simulation study and empirical analysis code
  supporting the paper below. If you use this code, please cite the paper;
  the estimators themselves are implemented in the companion clusterRCT
  package (https://github.com/lmiratrix/clusterRCT), which should be cited
  separately if used directly.
title: >-
  clusterRCTsim: Simulation and Empirical Analysis Code for "An Applied
  Researchers' Guide to Estimating Effects from Blocked Cluster Randomized
  Trials"
authors:
